      <Comment source="pmngroup">The terpene synthase coded by AT523960 in &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt; produces a number of volatile sesquiterpenes from farnesyl diphosphate. The variety of products can be accounted for by rearrangements in unstable intermediates|CITS: [15918888]|. The major product is (E)-&amp;beta;-caryophyllene, while 3 other identified compounds and 1 unidentified compound are also produced|CITS: [12566586]|.</Comment>
